OL,3,GNEWSAGunmen jailed for attempted murder
OL,4,Ain street
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who shot a man with handguns in
OL,7,Fa residential street in Huddersfield
OL,8,Fhave been jailed after being found
OL,9,Fguilty of attempted murder.
OL,11,FPolice said Nathaniel Collins and
OL,12,FMohammed Nageen, both aged 20, "fully
OL,13,Fintended to kill their victim" when
OL,14,Fthey fired the weapons at him in Smiths
OL,15,FAvenue in Marsh last December.
OL,17,FThe 32-year-old victim was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital for treatment for bullet
OL,19,Finjuries caused to his arm and leg.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
