OL,3,GNEWSAGunmen jailed for attempted murder
OL,4,Ain street
OL,5,
OL,6,FCollins, of St Paul's Road, was jailed
OL,7,Fat Leeds Crown Court for 27 years for
OL,8,Fattempted murder and possession of a
OL,9,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life
OL,10,Fwhile Nageen, of Ringwood Road, was
OL,11,Fgiven 25 years for the same offences.
